{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>Upon his naziriteship.</b> For the sake of his naziriteship — like <b>לכפר עליו</b> (to make atonement upon him), <b>כי עליך הורגנו</b> (for upon you we are killed), <b>כי עליך נשאתי חרפה</b> (for upon you I have borne reproach)." "<b>Besides what his hand attains.</b> Like <b>מלבד כל מתנותיכם</b> (besides all your gifts), <b>ומלבד כל נדריכם</b> (and besides all your vows), <b>ומלבד כל נדבותיכם</b> (and besides all your freewill offerings)."], :book :numbers, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:16:46.183492656Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}